    "text": "Ratna Pathak Shah praises Alia Bhatt\nIn a recent conversation with Pinkvilla, Ratna heaped praise on Alia and said, “Bahot hi attentive hai wo, tab maine jo note kiya unke baare mein. (She was very attentive.) She used to be at the monitor all the time — not when she was acting, but when others were performing. She observed very carefully.”",
